#: bazzite_portal/integration/decky.py:39
msgid "Plugin installation must run as your normal desktop user."
msgstr "你需爲桌面用戶以安裝插件。"

#: bazzite_portal/integration/decky.py:40
msgid "This Portal installation does not include the Decky plugin."
msgstr "此 Portal 的版本不包含 Decky 插件。"

#: bazzite_portal/integration/decky.py:41
msgid ""
"The bundled Decky plugin could not be verified. Reinstall Bazzite Portal and "
"try again."
msgstr "無法驗證捆綁的 Decky 插件安裝包。重新安裝 {bazzite} Portal 之後再試。"

#: bazzite_portal/integration/decky.py:42
msgid "Decky Loader is not installed."
msgstr "未安裝 Decky Loader。"

#: bazzite_portal/integration/decky.py:43
msgid "Decky Loader is not running. Start it and try again."
msgstr "Decky Loader 尚未運行，請啟動 Decky Loader 後再試。"

#: bazzite_portal/integration/decky.py:44
msgid "Open Steam in Gaming Mode or Big Picture, then try again."
msgstr "於遊戲模式或 Big Picture 模式中打開 Steam，然後再試。"

#: bazzite_portal/integration/decky.py:45
msgid "The installed Decky plugin version could not be verified."
msgstr "無法驗證安裝的 Decky 插件版本。"

#: bazzite_portal/integration/decky.py:46
msgid "The installed Decky plugin is up to date."
msgstr "安裝的 Decky 插件爲最新版本。"

#: bazzite_portal/integration/decky.py:47
msgid "The bundled plugin or installed version changed. Review it again."
msgstr "捆綁或安裝的的插件版本已變更。請再次查看它們。"

#: bazzite_portal/integration/decky.py:48
msgid ""
"Confirm the installation in Decky Loader. No change is made if you cancel."
msgstr "在 Decky Loader 中確認安裝。若你取消，將不會有任何更改。"

#: bazzite_portal/integration/decky.py:49
msgid ""
"Could not request plugin installation. Open Steam in Gaming Mode or Big "
"Picture and try again."
msgstr "無法請求安裝插件。於遊戲模式或 Big Picture 模式中打開 Steam，然後再試。"

